Expiry reminders in Google Tasks or Calendar

Usage:
  waxseal reminders [command]

Available Commands:
  clear       Remove a secret's reminders
  configure   Enable reminders and choose where they go
  sync        Create or update reminders for every key with an expiry

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for reminders

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change without changing anything
      --no-color        disable colour
      --no-input        never prompt; fail if an input is missing
  -o, --output string   output format: text or json (default "text")
      --repo string     path to the repository (default ".")
      --verbose         log subprocess calls and debug detail to stderr
  -y, --yes             answer yes to confirmations

Use "waxseal reminders [command] --help" for more information about a command.
